WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.290
Someone once said:

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:55.760
There are beasts whose entire body is 
marbled meat that melts in your mouth...

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:00.470
There are springs from which 
gush forth refreshing beverages

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:04.900
made from deep, rich juices of 
the highest quality muskmelons

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.940
and perfectly ripened mangoes,

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:13.710
in which endlessly dance 
bubbles of sweetness...

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:18.580
Progress is slow-going in the 
talks with developing nations,

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.380
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.850
but aside from the conference going smoothly,

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:25.290
anticipation is rising for 
the menu of the Gourmet Party

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.190
for all the different heads of state.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.430
People are enchanted by countless dishes!

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.530
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:09.070
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:22.080
The Undiscovered Giant Beast! 
Toriko, Capture a Gararagator!

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.390
U-Uh... My name is Komatsu.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.890
I came here with a job request 
for a Gourmet Hunter...

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.490
There's a gourmet party sponsored by

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:38.400
the International Gourmet 
Organization, the IGO.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.530
They'd like you to procure an ingredient

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:43.900
for one of the dishes served at the party.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.740
Um... Are you listening?

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:48.670
Toriko-san!

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.910
Got you!

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:15.170
That's my catch!

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.810
I got a Five-Tailed Eagle in the bargain!

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:31.820
Two birds with one stone, I guess?

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.480
A Crayfish Cod...

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:35.390
A Five-Tailed Eagle...

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.290
I've never seen them captured before!

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:39.920
It's so incredible...

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.460
Toriko-san, I know you can do it!

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.330
Capture a Gararagator!

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.030
What?!

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.660
Did you say a Gararagator?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:47.470
Yes.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:51.170
They're not just difficult to spot, 
their very existence is a mystery!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.510
They say they're tough to 
take out, even with a tank!

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:56.070
Truly ferocious...

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:01.380
An ingredient of the finest quality, 
where one slice is worth 100,000 yen.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:05.020
A meat so tender and delicious,

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.420
it's like a combination of the best king crab

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:10.490
with the super-high class 
A-rank Japanese beef!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:15.230
Gararagator! I can't get enough!

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:15.930
Then...

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:17.430
Time to head out!

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.400
Full speed ahead!

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:23.630
Sorry 'bout this, Tom.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.070
And why are you coming with me?

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:29.840
My boss told me to investigate 
the Gararagator.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.010
You, a chef?

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.280
How did you know I was a chef?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.450
It is true I am a master chef 
at Hotel Gourmet, but...

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:40.550
That's a Five-Star Hotel!

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.490
I could tell, since your hands 
smell like top-class ingredients.

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:49.830
Handling them everyday, your 
hands have absorbed the smell.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.200
Toriko's sense of smell's even 
better than a police dog.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.000
Treat me to a full course sometime!

00:05:57.570 --> 00:05:59.870
Yum! It's a 20-fold rice ball!

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:00.940
It's true...

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:04.910
A sense of smell is crucial not just 
for aroma, but also for judging taste.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:06.780
This is a Gourmet Hunter...

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.580
One who searches out never-before 
seen ingredients, and eats them!

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.450
The culinary questers...

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:13.550
Gourmet Hunters.

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.590
One of them, who has discovered about 2%,

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:21.360
or 6000 different types of ingredients 
out of the 300,000 that are known,

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.130
is a charismatic figure of the Gourmet Age...

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.430
The Gourmet Hunter Toriko!

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:25.930
He's just so amazing!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.300
How much are you going to eat!?

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:32.470
Almond Cabbage is delicious!

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:34.940
I can see it now...

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.340
The Baron Archipelago!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.760
What're those?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.060
Friday Monkeys...

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.030
They're very wary and cowardly.

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:00.830
They ain't gonna attack.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.870
But why are they here?

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.440
We've arrived.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:13.210
The sole entrance to the Baron 
Archipelago, a mangrove tunnel.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.480
Also known as the Devil's Mouth.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:24.520
Sharks...

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.090
Sharks are circling us...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.390
Baron Sharks.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.060
Considering their size, 
these are Capture Level 1.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.130
Capture Level 1?!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:37.970
IGO (International Gourmet 
Organization) Standard

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:37.970
Capture Level 1

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:37.270
That's a level where it takes 
10 pro hunters to take it down!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.070
And...

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.140
...there are so many...

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.610
W-W-W-What's that?!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:49.780
Just the roar of some beast.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.020
There are over 50,000 creatures that 
live here in the Baron Archipelago.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:58.920
And the one that reigns over 
them all is the Gararagator!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.560
R-Right...

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.330
The Gararagator gets more 
ferocious the older it gets.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:08.130
The ones that have lived for 
150 years have Capture Level 5.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:11.840
Capture Level 5

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:11.840
A level where even an IGO tank might 
not be enough to take it down...

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:15.340
I was prepared for this, 
but man, this is scary!

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:18.080
We're here.

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:29.450
Maybe I made the wrong choices in life...

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.320
Act now and it's your lucky day!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:34.030
Wait until tomorrow, and luck 
will never come your way!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.630
I think acting right away made 
for one unlucky day so far...

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:42.870
Something's sticking to me!

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:45.270
It's just a bloodsucking Baron Leech.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:45.940
Don't worry about it.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.340
I am worrying about it!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.510
If you yank it out, it'll 
just open up the wound.

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:53.340
Please, help me!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.280
Huh? How did you...

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.690
The mangrove leaves have absorbed 
the seawater's salinity.

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.290
So the leeches hate them.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:06.760
I see.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.500
This is really creepy...

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:17.300
Wait!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.340
I really shouldn't have come...

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:28.850
Baron Tiger (Mammalian Beast)

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:28.850
Capture Level 3

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.180
A Baron Tiger!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.920
Capture Level 3?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.450
That's a level that takes 
30 soldiers to take down!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.690
My life is over...

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:40.790
You wanna...

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.190
...cross fangs with me?!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:47.230
Huh?

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.400
Something is definitely odd.

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:53.370
The Baron Tiger should live 
deep in the Baron Bog...

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.340
It shouldn't be around here.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.740
The Friday Monkeys are the same way.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.080
They're such cowards they spend 
their whole lives in caves,

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.680
so for them to be on the shore...

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:06.380
The only explanation is that their 
habitat is being threatened...

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:09.120
It ain't some Level 5 Gararagator...

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:10.990
It's something even bigger!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:15.560
A predator so overwhelmingly powerful it 
stands on the top of the food chain...

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:19.230
This predator is...

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.000
I might be able to use them for 
the first time in a while...

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:29.070
Fork and Knife!

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:01.340
I give thanks for this world's bounty.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:04.440
These are good!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.840
But it's really quiet...

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.580
I can't even hear the roars 
of beasts any longer...

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.680
I get the feeling like the closer we get 
to the territory of the Gararagator,

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.850
the less living things there are...

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.220
I bet that predator ate them.

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:20.590
I dunno what kind of giant thing it is,

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:24.560
but it might eat every living thing 
in the Baron Archipelago before long.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:28.100
All the living things on these 
islands are in danger...

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:29.930
And that includes me, too!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.470
Ah, this is terrible.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:34.770
The bleeding from where the 
leech stung me won't stop...

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:39.540
That's because leeches use a chemical 
called hirudin to slow blood clotting.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.910
Well, it'll stop eventually.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.020
Eventually? When's that?

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.030
Swamp Snake (Reptilian Beast)

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.030
Capture Level 5

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:02.930
A Swamp Snake!

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.440
What is this wound?

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:17.380
It was done in by a single bite...

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:21.550
What? That's impossible!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:25.320
A Swamp Snake is Capture Level 5! 
The same level as a Gararagator!

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.190
Yeah...

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:28.490
You don't see a jaw this size every day.

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:33.930
But how was something as hard 
to find as a Swamp Snake...

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.400
Those are...

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:37.540
Baron Leeches!

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.970
The smell of blood must have come 
from the Baron Leeches sucking on it!

00:12:56.620 --> 00:13:00.020
Oh yeah... You were stung by a 
Baron Leech too, weren't you?

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:05.860
I guess we were targeted the second 
we set foot on this island.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.170
By you, Gararagator!

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:18.280
I-It's so huge!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.050
And it's raising Baron Leeches!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:24.280
I never seen a Gararagator as big as this.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.920
150 years old? More like twice that!

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:29.020
This big fella's lived 
for more than 300 years!

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.090
This is nowhere near Capture Level 5!

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:36.660
The IGO doesn't have any data on this!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:39.060
Yeah. This explains it.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.970
The overwhelming predator...

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:44.540
Is it you?!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.370
300 Year-old Gararagator  (Reptilian Beast)

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.370
Estimated Capture Level 8

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.140
Toriko-san, watch out!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.680
300 years old...

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:57.620
I bet the taste of your meat has 
been aged quite excellently!

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.780
Is now the time to be talking about taste?!

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:06.690
You might become part of my Full Course Menu!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:52.900
Toriko-san!

00:14:56.470 --> 00:15:00.710
This guy senses the smell of blood 
and snatches at it anywhere!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.480
This'll be annoying if it drags out...

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.420
Gararagator...

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.920
Your hard scales...

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.360
Your sharp claws...

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:13.760
Your strong fangs...

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.830
Your jaw, said to bite with 3 tons of force!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:21.170
Truly, you look suited to reign supreme 
here in the Baron Archipelago.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.700
I offer you my respect.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:31.140
I shall show you the weapons of a human!

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:34.310
H-He's a demon...

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.720
I give thanks for all this world's bounty.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.390
Now let's eat!

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.450
Fork!

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.890
Knife!

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:32.870
Thank you for this excellent meal.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.010
W-Whoa...

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:43.510
This is the Gourmet Hunter Toriko...

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:56.230
I have a report that the disturbance 
at the Baron Archipelago

00:16:56.230 --> 00:16:58.800
was due to a Gararagator.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:02.830
It is unfortunate it was not 
that certain ingredient.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:07.570
However, I have one more interesting report.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:10.580
That the one who took down that Gararagator

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.510
was one of the Four Heavenly Kings, Toriko.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.410
Oh...

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:19.250
So the Four Heavenly Kings are 
starting to make their move?

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:24.660
Is this okay?

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.030
I mean, eating the ingredient 
for the party here...

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:28.230
Why not?

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:31.530
It's not like we can carry something 
so huge back with us anyway.

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:35.570
Look at the marbling on 
this meat, it's sparkling!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:38.770
Like the stars twinkling in the night sky!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.270
I give thanks for this world's bounty.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.510
I can't get enough!

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:50.480
The tender, juicy meat... 
Just one bite and...

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:53.220
The juice just keeps flowing 
out, and flowing out!

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.590
It's like a flood of juiciness!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.160
I-I'll have some, too!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.600
This meaty flavor, and the 
fat melting in my mouth...

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:07.330
I know!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.770
If I roast it on a heated stone...

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.740
As the fat released from the 
meat roasts the outside,

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:19.080
the juice will be locked up inside.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:20.780
Finished!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:28.720
The outside is crispy and smells delicious!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.490
The inside is tender and juicy!

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:36.390
Delicious!

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:43.270
But why would someone like you who 
could make something like this

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.340
come all the way out to 
the Baron Archipelago?

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:49.540
My dream is to become a top-tier chef.

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:53.610
Unless I know the true 
form of my ingredients,

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.580
I'm sure I can't create the best dishes.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.820
I realized this the first time 
I saw you hunt, Toriko-san.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.420
Sure, it's dangerous.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:09.730
But I wanted to see a 
Gararagator when it was alive.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:16.630
When I eat something delicious, 
power wells up throughout my body.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:22.810
Eating, cooking... It's 
how we gain life's power.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:26.680
And that's why we give thanks.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:30.920
Toriko-san!

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:34.190
Toriko-san, what is your dream?

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:38.390
My dream is to create a 
Full Course Menu of life.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.590
A Full Course Menu of life?

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:42.030
Yes...

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.700
Starting with the Hors D'Oeuvre...

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:53.770
Then Soup, Fish, Meat, Main 
Dish, Salad, Dessert, and Drink.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:57.110
I've decided on one of them.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.150
My menu might be full of blanks right now,

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:05.320
but one day I'll complete it, for sure.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:08.990
There's still plenty of delicious 
things out there in this world

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:10.250
that no one knows about!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:15.490
I want to meet all those different 
delicacies! All those different creatures!

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.000
Toriko-san's Full Course...

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:29.410
Toriko-san, if there's ever another 
chance like this, may I come with you?

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:31.780
Suit yourself.

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.650
Act now and it's your lucky day.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:41.020
Wait until tomorrow, and luck will 
never come your way... Right?

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:45.020
Komatsu, let's grill them one after another!

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:48.330
Right, Toriko-san!

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.930
This is the best, Komatsu!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.100
I'm in high-gear! There's no stopping me now!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:55.270
Yes! It's just too delicious!

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.070
Grill more!

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:58.070
Right, Toriko-san!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.140
Leave it to me!

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:01.440
Huh?

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.610
Thank you for this excellent meal.

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:05.280
What the...

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:08.580
You shouldn't eat it all, Toriko-san!

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:11.850
Never let food go to waste!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.990
That's my rule!

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:16.450
Ah, I'm stuffed!

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:19.290
But I told you not to eat it all!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.530
What'll I tell my boss?

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:26.430
Just tell 'im how incredibly yummy it was!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.300
Give me a break here!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:32.640
I'm gonna be fired before I ever 
get a chance to be a great chef!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.610
Man, that was tasty.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:38.710
But... Still a bit away from 
being a part of my Full Course.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.480
We're ending on a downer?!

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:55.130
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:55.660 --> 00:22:01.400
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:08.640
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:13.580
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:18.650
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.020
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:26.490
on a journey with no end!

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:31.460
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.600
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:40.640
amid the waves of time.

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:45.540
Gourmet News!

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:47.980
Good morning!

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:49.380
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:49.780 --> 00:22:52.080
What were the ingredients that 
Toriko-san captured today?

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:53.150
Crayfish Cod.

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:54.720
Five-Tailed Eagle.

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:55.920
Snake Frog.

00:22:56.420 --> 00:22:57.390
Gararagator.

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:00.690
That Gararagator looks so delicious...

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:04.060
And now, the next story...

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.640
The Rainbow Fruit has ripened!

00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:11.800
But, a nest of Troll Kongs makes retrieving it dangerous!

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:13.580
Toriko takes on the hunt.

00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:16.800
The Well Mellowed 7-Colored Fruit Juice! 
Pick the Rainbow Fruit!

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:19.400
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
